[I] Open source HTML Renderer library

[T] Lexbor is a set of fast, standards-compliant modules for working with
[T] modern web technologies, such as HTML parsing, DOM, CSS processing, URL
[T] handling and encodings, forming the base of a browser engine. It is
[T] written in pure C99 without dependencies and follows the WHATWG and W3C
[T] specifications.

[U] https://lexbor.com

[A] Lexbor Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

